--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ sentry constructed and tested: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ failed stream: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
